# Which tests each part of the repo needs. Read by platform/test/select.sh (make test-changed, CI, the push gate).
# Rows: <globs><TAB><targets>. First matching row wins per changed path. A path under apps/<name>/ that is not
# "none" here selects only that app's apps/<name>/test_*.sh, whatever its row says.
# Globs (space-separated): anchored; **/ is zero or more directories; a trailing /** is everything beneath;
# * and ? stop at /.
# Targets (comma-separated): a platform/<area> directory name, apps (every app), none, or all.
# A test that reads another area (../<area>/ or ../lib/) needs that area's row to list the test's own area;
# test_areas_map.sh enforces it.
README.md **/README.md docs/** .claude/**	none
Makefile .github/** platform/test/**	all
CLAUDE.md	host
platform/lib/**	registry,data,host,backup,jobs,ingress,deploy,apps
platform/registry/**	registry,data,host,backup,jobs,lint,deploy,apps
platform/data/**	data,host,backup,jobs,lint,deploy,apps
platform/jobs/**	jobs,host,lint,apps
platform/backup/**	backup,host,data,lint,apps
platform/ingress/**	ingress,host,lint,apps
platform/host/**	host,data,backup,jobs,lint,apps
platform/deploy/**	deploy,host,lint,data
platform/lint/**	lint
platform/ci/**	ci
**	all
